<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 920 560" width="920" height="560">
<defs><marker id="a" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z" fill="#34495e"/></marker></defs>
<rect width="920" height="560" fill="#ffffff"/>
<text x="20" y="26" font-size="16" font-weight="700" font-family="Arial" fill="#111">Falcon Strike-AI: architecture and data flow</text>
<rect x="20" y="50" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dfe6e9" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="95.0" y="71.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="95.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">1. AWS lab</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">(moto mock or</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">real lab account)</tspan></text>
<rect x="200" y="50" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dff0ff" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="275.0" y="78.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="275.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">2. Collectors</tspan><tspan x="275.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">read-only boto3</tspan></text>
<rect x="380" y="50" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dff0ff" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="455.0" y="71.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="455.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">3. Graph builder</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">nodes, edges,</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">misconfig labels</tspan></text>
<rect x="560" y="50" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dff0ff" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="635.0" y="71.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="635.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">4. Path engine</tspan><tspan x="635.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">find + rank</tspan><tspan x="635.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">attack paths</tspan></text>
<rect x="740" y="50" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#fff2cc" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="815.0" y="71.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="815.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">5. LLM planner</tspan><tspan x="815.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">PROPOSES JSON</tspan><tspan x="815.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">never executes</tspan></text>
<line x1="170" y1="81" x2="200" y2="81" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="350" y1="81" x2="380" y2="81" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="530" y1="81" x2="560" y2="81" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="710" y1="81" x2="740" y2="81" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<rect x="560" y="170" width="330" height="66" rx="8" fill="#f8d7da" stroke="#a94442"/><text x="725.0" y="193.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="725.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">6. GUARDRAIL GATE (policy)</tspan><tspan x="725.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">allowlist · schema · technique allowlist</tspan><tspan x="725.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">account scope · egress · caps</tspan></text>
<line x1="815" y1="112" x2="815" y2="170" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<rect x="380" y="290" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e2f0d9" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="455.0" y="311.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="455.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">7. Orchestrator</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">dry-run default</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">two-key for live</tspan></text>
<rect x="200" y="290" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e2f0d9" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="275.0" y="311.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="275.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">8. Live techniques</tspan><tspan x="275.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">5 harmless, reversible</tspan><tspan x="275.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">modules + cloud adapter</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="290" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e2f0d9" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="95.0" y="311.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="95.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">9. C2 beacon + sink</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">jitter, inert marker</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">loopback only</tspan></text>
<line x1="560" y1="203" x2="530" y2="290" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="380" y1="321" x2="350" y2="321" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="200" y1="321" x2="170" y2="321" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<rect x="20" y="400" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dff0ff" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="95.0" y="421.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="95.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">10. IOCs from audit log</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">ground truth</tspan><tspan x="95.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">(verified chain)</tspan></text>
<rect x="200" y="400" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#dff0ff" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="275.0" y="421.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="275.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">11. Detection stub</tspan><tspan x="275.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">rules -> detected /</tspan><tspan x="275.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">partial / missed, MTTD</tspan></text>
<rect x="380" y="400" width="150" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e2f0d9" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="455.0" y="421.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="455.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">12. SOC report</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">HTML · MD · JSON</tspan><tspan x="455.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">heatmap + remediation</tspan></text>
<line x1="95" y1="352" x2="95" y2="400" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="170" y1="431" x2="200" y2="431" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<line x1="350" y1="431" x2="380" y2="431" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<rect x="580" y="400" width="310" height="62" rx="8" fill="#fde2c8" stroke="#b9770e"/><text x="735.0" y="421.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="735.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">VERIFIED TEARDOWN (always, in finally)</tspan><tspan x="735.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">delete tracked resources, then compare</tspan><tspan x="735.0" dy="14" font-weight="400">lab state to recorded baseline</tspan></text>
<line x1="530" y1="321" x2="580" y2="420" stroke="#34495e" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a)"/>
<rect x="20" y="490" width="540" height="28" rx="8" fill="#e8daef" stroke="#34495e"/><text x="290.0" y="508.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="290.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">AUDIT LOG: append-only, hash-chained, written before + after every action</tspan></text>
<rect x="580" y="490" width="310" height="28" rx="8" fill="#f5b7b1" stroke="#a94442"/><text x="735.0" y="508.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#111" font-family="Arial"><tspan x="735.0" dy="0" font-weight="700">KILL SWITCH · time-box · caps · circuit breaker</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="545" font-size="11" fill="#555" font-family="Arial">Safety layer wraps every stage: preflight (account allowlist first, then token + --confirm-live for live mode).</text>
</svg>